    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Operating guidelines"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                135,
                84,
                305,
                103
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "table",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/610ad36f88f0b38b09ec7066785e0bf9317b1952a430c246654dd1c0f1ecdadd.jpg"
                },
                "table_caption": [],
                "table_footnote": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "# Subject to change from time to time as per banks policy."
                    }
                ],
                "html": "<table><tr><td>Type of service</td><td>Savings (individuals)</td><td>Senior Citizen / Differently Abled</td><td>Current Account Customers</td></tr><tr><td>Cash Pickup</td><td>20,000 per instance</td><td>20,000 per instance</td><td>5 lacs per instance</td></tr><tr><td>Cash Delivery</td><td>20,000 per instance</td><td>20,000 per instance</td><td>5 lacs per instance</td></tr></table>",
                "table_type": "simple_table",
                "table_nest_level": 1
            },
            "bbox": [
                151,
                118,
                828,
                244
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The Door step banking service can be offered by the bank through any of the following means."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                135,
                282,
                841,
                300
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "By Banks own regular staff"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                161,
                311,
                403,
                329
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Outsourcing the operations to a Cash management vendor who have national / regional presence with a good track record. The outsourcing to such vendor will be governed by the outsourcing policy of the bank."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                163,
                340,
                872,
                392
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Through banking correspondents empaneled with the bank."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                163,
                402,
                633,
                421
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Services provided through outsourcing or through banking correspondents will be through a mutually signed agreement detailing the terms and conditions including charges for executing these services, turnaround time."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                133,
                431,
                872,
                481
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Process of service delivery"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                133,
                493,
                348,
                510
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The service request for Door-Step delivery can be received at the branch or through any secure convenient channel like phone banking, IVR, Internet Banking, Mobile Banking or call center where the requests are authenticated using TPIN or any other acceptable authentication methodology."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                133,
                521,
                872,
                571
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The service will be offered across all the branches of Unity Bank"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                161,
                582,
                678,
                599
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "• These services will be rendered to the customer by the bank ONLY at customer's premises or residence, as per the address registered with the Bank"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                161,
                599,
                870,
                633
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Requests made through branches before 11:00 a.m. will be attended on the same day. Requests made post 11:00 a.m. will be attended on the next working day"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                161,
                633,
                870,
                667
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The limits of cash pickup and delivery will be decided by bank from time to time. This may vary from type of account held to different variant within a single type of accounts. A representative grid but which are subject to change on the limits on cash delivery / pickup are detailed below. #"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                161,
                667,
                872,
                733
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Cash collected from the customer will be issued an acknowledgement by way of receipts / Registered (Mobile no's) SMS / Registered e – mail."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                163,
                734,
                872,
                768
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "For instruments like cheques the customers will be informed about the probable date of credit into the account through suitable means like SMS (To registered mobile no.) Email id (registered with the bank)."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                163,
                768,
                874,
                816
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Use of technology is encouraged to credit / debit the customer on real time basis."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                163,
                819,
                792,
                835
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The bank will make true efforts (On Best effort basis) to complete the request on the day of on-boarding of the request before 11 a.m. However, in scenarios where the bank is unable to complete the request on the same day in spite of receiving the instruction before 11 a.m., the customer will be informed accordingly, to avoid further inconvenience."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                161,
                835,
                874,
                902
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footer",
            "content": {
                "page_footer_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Version 4.0 Master Policy on Customer Service"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                107,
                912,
                354,
                943
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
